-wik-032","title":"DNS over HTTPS 与 DNS over TLS"},{"id":"art-wik-033","title":"fake-ip 与 redir-host"},{"id":"art-wik-034","title":"原生 IP 与广播 IP"},{"id":"art-wik-035","title":"共享 IP 与独立 IP"},{"id":"art-wik-036","title":"DNS IP与数据可见性完整说明"}]}]}]};
const topic = {"id":"performance-and-privacy","name":"网络性能与隐私边界","slug":"performance-and-privacy","url":"/wiki/performance-and-privacy/","h1":"网络性能与隐私边界：延迟丢包抖动测量、DoH/DoT与原生/广播IP区别","desc":"厘清网络指标真实物理含义，建立fake-ip分流与服务商数据可见边界的科学认知。","clusters":[{"id":"metrics-and-meanings","name":"性能指标与测量含义","slug":"metrics-and-meanings","url":"/wiki/performance-and-privacy/metrics-and-meanings/","h1":"性能指标与测量含义：RTT延迟、抖动Jitter、丢包率与带宽吞吐差异","coreQuestion":"平时说的Ping值到底代表什么？带宽1000M为什么实际吞吐只有10M？","articles":[{"id":"art-wik-025","title":"延迟、抖动、丢包指标"},{"id":"art-wik-026","title":"带宽与吞吐的区别"},{"id":"art-wik-027","title":"峰值速度与持续速度"},{"id":"art-wik-028","title":"性能指标的测量方法"},{"id":"art-wik-029","title":"性能指标的解读"},{"id":"art-wik-030","title":"性能指标与测量含义完整说明"}]},{"id":"dns-ip-visibility","name":"DNS IP与数据可见性","slug":"dns-ip-visibility","url":"/wiki/performance-and-privacy/dns-ip-visibility/","h1":"DNS IP与数据可见性：DoH加密解析、fake-ip机制与原生/广播IP风控","coreQuestion":"机场老板能看到我浏览的网页内容和密码吗？原生IP和机房IP到底差在哪？","articles":[{"id":"art-wik-031","title":"DNS 解析流程"},{"id":"art-wik-032","title":"DNS over HTTPS 与 DNS over TLS"},{"id":"art-wik-033","title":"fake-ip 与 redir-host"},{"id":"art-wik-034","title":"原生 IP 与广播 IP"},{"id":"art-wik-035","title":"共享 IP 与独立 IP"},{"id":"art-wik-036","title":"DNS IP与数据可见性完整说明"}]}]};
